<title>USA: Indosat at 27-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Indosat at 27-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) closed at 27-3/8 in New York on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of 27-3/8 and the day's high of 27-3/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 2,800 American Depository Shares. Block volume was nil. Its previous close on Tuesday was 27-3/8.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
